      "text": "The docstring says the productions \"contain\" the cell values of the rows in each access order, but the formula says more: `productions` equals `some` of the deduplicated list of those productions, in the order of `Table.accessOrders`, so no other production can occur. Fix: say that the productions are exactly one production for each order in {name}`Table.accessOrders`, in that order, with each repeated production removed after its first occurrence."
